    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139100/extras/dc1eaac2fdfe09108a61f058a5d747aa.avif?t=1661085633\" /></div><br>Everyone has a dream, even an <strong>egg</strong>. <br><br>Roll your way around to live out your dreams in a world where you don't always belong.<br><br>You are an egg. You have goals, dreams, desires and a passion.<br>Explore the world in a way that only an egg can and progress through the story of your life but watch out as an egg is a very fragile thing.<br><br>Will you live out your dreams, or will you <strong><u>crack</u></strong> under the pressure of being something great?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139100/extras/4db77f5b2af98cd8623a2662e824dd44.poster.avif?t=1661085633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139100/extras/4db77f5b2af98cd8623a2662e824dd44.webm?t=1661085633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139100/extras/4db77f5b2af98cd8623a2662e824dd44.mp4?t=1661085633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139100/extras/44a115787f04fbd8d5f9c074b354ac2a.avif?t=1661085633\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Third Person Rolling Action<br></li><li>Crazy Difficult Platforming<br></li><li>Interactive Physics Based Objects<br></li><li>Explore unique environments through the perspective of an egg<br></li><li>Comic Book Style Story Cut-Scenes<br></li><li>Original Soundtrack by M0r53C0d3</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Check Out One Of Our Other Games!</h2>",
